<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings-wk ended Oct 26--AAR.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings-wk ended Oct 26--AAR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		Pct Change   Week Ending:	   Year-Ago</p>
<p>    -		   In Week---10/26/96  10/19/96     Week</p>
<p> Grain		     4.0	29,309    28,179    28,063</p>
<p> Grain Mill Products   2.5	 9,910     9,672     9,473</p>
<p> Other Farm Products  UNCH	 2,433     2,434     2,593</p>
<p> Metallic Ores	 -16.0	16,849    20,068    18,629</p>
